diff --git a/docs/p19-r2/VERIFICATION_PLANE_1_20.txt b/docs/p19-r2/VERIFICATION_PLANE_1_20.txt
new file mode 100644
index 0000000..490d239
--- /dev/null
+++ b/docs/p19-r2/VERIFICATION_PLANE_1_20.txt
@@ -0,0 +1,19 @@
+Verification Plane 1.20 — P12 R1C3 plan results into the P7 registration chain
+
+The request-bound Source planning seam now has an admission intake: one
+revalidated SourceCompositionResult enters the ORIGINAL P7A shadow compiler and
+the existing GatewayStateStore registration + executable-plan sealing entry in a
+single Unit of Work, with P19 authorities and method-source retention intact.
+The trivalent contract is preserved exactly: PROVED_INVALID is refused with its
+original findings, UNKNOWN is admitted only as PROVISIONAL_ALLOW with mandatory
+verification, and PROVED_VALID remains mechanical proof. Registration reports
+its stages separately and structurally cannot report granted, executed or
+completed; Policy/Ticket/Grant/A5 and Completion are untouched.
+
+Add src/total_gateway/composition_registration_intake.py to the inherited frozen
+surface. Preserve every prior member. Changed prior members are the existing
+Method run reader (one delegating register_composition method, prepare/compile
+and the sealed-Plan read API unchanged) and the V3 installed-reader bridge (one
+register_production_composition entry beside the existing prepare/compile pair).
+No second Store, registry, Runtime, Gateway, Planner or completion authority is
+introduced; the Store schema (v33) and all prior protections are unchanged.
diff --git a/docs/p19-r2/VERIFICATION_PLANE_1_21.txt b/docs/p19-r2/VERIFICATION_PLANE_1_21.txt
new file mode 100644
index 0000000..3ea8d66
--- /dev/null
+++ b/docs/p19-r2/VERIFICATION_PLANE_1_21.txt
@@ -0,0 +1,20 @@
+Verification Plane 1.21 — P12 R1E/R1F/R1G-prep surface extension
+
+The capability context slot now admits system-recalled capability experience
+instead of the hard-coded empty tuple: only STABLE positive lifecycle states
+pass at the slot, refusals are counted in an explicit ABI marker, and every
+entry is digest-covered with experience_data_only=true. The write-back side
+assembles one P5 observation from the durable roundtrip records through the
+original attribution evaluator; the P5 admission/statistics policy remains
+the sole writer and nothing promotes an experience by itself.
+
+Add src/world_understanding/capability_composition/composition_experience_bridge.py
+and src/world_understanding/capability_composition/formal_shadow.py to the
+inherited frozen surface (the latter integrated unchanged from the unmerged
+P11 evaluation branch). Preserve every prior member. Changed prior members
+are the existing world reference context builder and its context handler
+(experience parameters and provider seam; the default no-provider path stays
+byte-compatible) plus the single version source and this freeze. The
+compiler's additive plan_binds_proposal proof from the P11 branch lands
+outside the frozen list, covered by its own test suite. No Store, registry,
+Runtime, Gateway or completion authority changes; schema stays v33.
diff --git a/docs/p19-r2/VERIFICATION_PLANE_1_22.txt b/docs/p19-r2/VERIFICATION_PLANE_1_22.txt
