+++ b/docs/p19-r2/VERIFICATION_PLANE_1_22.txt
@@ -0,0 +1,19 @@
+Verification Plane 1.22 — P15-A tool-source publication preflight
+
+A Tool-source bundle publication now flows into the ONE World invalidation
+chain, mirroring the Method publication path: one SYSTEM_GOVERNANCE envelope
+names the published bundle digest, the operator-configured resolver verifies
+the bundle bytes through the original P8 reader and compiles the exact Tool
+Capability World, and the original materializer replaces ONLY the Tool domain
+while precise changed_source_keys (tool-world:<old/new snapshot>) invalidate
+exactly the tool-bound records. Same-digest different-byte bundles are
+refused by the original reader; duplicate publications replay idempotently;
+unrelated records and the sealed-plan readers are untouched.
+
+Add src/world_understanding/tool_capability_world/publication.py to the
+inherited frozen surface. Preserve every prior member. Changed prior members
+are the single production runtime (tool publication routing, install seam and
+consumer beside the Method path) plus the single version source and this
+freeze. The Gateway-side resolver lives outside the frozen list and holds no
+authority of its own; no second invalidation store, registry, planner route
+or execution grant is introduced. Store stays v33.
diff --git a/docs/p19-r2/VERIFICATION_PLANE_1_23.txt b/docs/p19-r2/VERIFICATION_PLANE_1_23.txt
new file mode 100644
index 0000000..4e6327c
--- /dev/null
+++ b/docs/p19-r2/VERIFICATION_PLANE_1_23.txt
@@ -0,0 +1,20 @@
+Verification Plane 1.23 — admission materialization and recall seam
+
+Two self-recorded integration gaps close on the frozen surface. The
+admission materializer derives the FULL system side of a P7 admission
+from one compiled SourceCompositionResult — authority-derived workspace,
+per-intent verifier evidence, per-step invocation bindings straight from
+the sealed preparation, and the activation window — while semantic values
+arrive only through the system channel and refusals are explicit. The
+controlled composition turn can therefore register end to end with no
+hand-assembled admission fixtures. The production runtime gains the
+operator-pinned experience-recall installation seam onto the context
+handler; absent installation stays a legal cold start and a failing
+provider never breaks the canonical context path.
+
+Add src/total_gateway/composition_admission_materialization.py to the
+inherited frozen surface. Preserve every prior member. Changed prior
+members are the single installed-reader bridge (one installation
+function beside the existing prepare/compile pair) plus the single
+version source and this freeze. No Store, registry, Runtime, Gateway or
+completion authority changes; schema stays v33.
